;; nvd-clojure configuration. Run with: bb audit
;;
;; NOTE the shape: nvd-clojure wraps this WHOLE FILE under :nvd itself
;; (nvd.config/parse-edn-file), so the settings here are written at top
;; level. The first version nested them under :nvd — which put the CVSS
;; threshold at [:nvd :nvd ...] where nothing ever read it, so the build
;; failed on ANY finding of any severity and the 7.0 gate below was dead
;; from the day it was written. Discovered when a LOW false positive
;; failed the build.
;;
;; An NVD API key is required; see docs/DEVELOPING.md.
{:fail-build-on-cvss-score 7.0
 :suppression-file ".nvd-suppressions.xml"}
